        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A lumbar cushion is wider than it is tall: 50 cm across, 30 cm high. Two panels seamed together fit a standard 50 x 30 cm lumbar insert. Around 380 m total."
          }
        ]
      },
